    {
      "name": "Hellfire Breath",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "fire"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The hell hound breathes flames that deal <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">10d6</span> fire damage to all creatures in a 15 foot cone (DC 28 basic Reflex save.)</p>\n<p>The hell hound can't use Hellfire Breath again for <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> rounds. If the greater hell hound would take fire damage or be targeted by a fire effect, their Hellfire Breath recharges.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
